UnitDynamicSwapFeeHook::_GetFee
├── when block fee is zero
│   └── it computes and returns the first swap fee to use and store
├── when first tx fee is not zero
│   └── it returns the intial fee
├── when block fee is not ZERO_FEE_INDICATOR
│   └── it returns (block fee, 0)
└── when block fee is ZERO_FEE_INDICATOR
    └── it returns (0, 0)
